			<item>
				<title>Get Involved</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/join/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/join/</guid>
				<description>&lt;style&gt;&#xA;.join-page{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem clamp(1rem,4vw,4rem) 4rem}&#xA;.join-hero{padding:4rem 1rem 2rem;text-align:center}&#xA;.join-hero h1{color:#33342e;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,7vw,5rem)}&#xA;.join-hero p{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:1.25rem}&#xA;.join-goals{margin:0 0 3rem;padding:2rem clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3.5rem);background:#f7f3e8;border-left:10px solid #ffde16}&#xA;.join-goals h2{margin:0 0 1rem;text-align:left;font-size:1.5rem}&#xA;.join-goals ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.5rem}&#xA;.join-goals li{margin:.75rem 0;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.5}&#xA;.random-call{margin:0 0 3rem;padding:2rem clamp(1.5rem,4vw,3.5rem);border-top:1px solid #33342e;border-bottom:1px solid #33342e;color:#33342e;text-align:center}&#xA;.random-call h2{margin:0 0 .75rem;color:#33342e;font-size:1.5rem}&#xA;.random-call p{margin:0 auto 1.25rem;max-width:700px;font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.5}&#xA;.welcome-grid{display:grid;width:100%;min-width:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.5rem;contain:inline-size}&#xA;.welcome-card{display:flex;width:100%;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;flex-direction:column;background:#f7f3e8;border-top:10px solid #ffde16;padding:1.75rem;color:#33342e;overflow:hidden}&#xA;.welcome-card h2{margin:0 0 .25rem;color:#33342e;text-align:left;font-size:1.45rem;letter-spacing:.08em}&#xA;.welcome-card h3{margin:0 0 1.25rem;color:#33342e;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}&#xA;.welcome-card .btn{display:flex;align-self:center;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:fit-content;min-height:3.25rem;margin:0 0 1.5rem;text-align:center}&#xA;.welcome-card details{width:100%;min-width:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(51,52,46,.25);padding-top:1rem}&#xA;.welcome-card summary{cursor:pointer;color:#33342e;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;overflow-wrap:anywhere}&#xA;.welcome-card summary::marker{color:#33342e}&#xA;.welcome-card summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #33342e;outline-offset:4px}&#xA;.welcome-card details p{margin:1rem 0 0;color:#33342e;text-align:left;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65;overflow-wrap:anywhere}&#xA;@media(max-width:600px){.join-page{padding-left:1rem;padding-right:1rem}.join-goals{padding:1.5rem}.welcome-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}&#xA;&lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;join-page&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;section class=&#34;join-hero&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1&gt;GET INVOLVED&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;Get to know us and how you can best get involved through a quick chat with one of our welcome team members.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;  &lt;section class=&#34;join-goals&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2&gt;Goals&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;Get to know Sunrise &amp;amp; answer any of your questions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;Find out what motivates &lt;strong&gt;YOU!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;Find out what we can do to better support your engagement in activism - especially with respect to inclusivity and accessibility&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;Help you find the right avenue for getting more involved &amp;amp; take action!&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;  &lt;section class=&#34;random-call&#34; aria-labelledby=&#34;random-call-title&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;random-call-title&#34;&gt;Not sure who to pick?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;There’s no wrong choice! Let us pick a welcome team member for you and start with a chat.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; id=&#34;random-call-link&#34; href=&#34;#&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Choose someone for me&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;  &lt;section class=&#34;welcome-grid&#34; aria-label=&#34;Welcome team members&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;article class=&#34;welcome-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h2&gt;Ashmu&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3&gt;Hub Coordinator&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://cal.com/ashmu?members=1&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Chat with Ashmu&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;details&gt;&#xA;        &lt;summary&gt;More about Ashmu&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Aloha! 🌺 My name is Ashmu (pronounced ash-moo like a cow), pronouns she/her, and I am originally from Oahu, Hawai‘i. I’ve lived in the Bay for about 4 years now and love it! I’ve been a member of Sunrise Movement since 2024, and have been &lt;strong&gt;Hub Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt; for the Sunrise Bay Area Hub since January 2025. I also am the &lt;strong&gt;Communications/Media Lead&lt;/strong&gt; for the hub. Sunrise has truly been life changing for me, and a place where I&#39;ve grown and learned so much. I can&#39;t wait for the same for you!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;I am open for &lt;strong&gt;Intro Calls&lt;/strong&gt; if you are brand new and don&#39;t know where to start. Any of the Welcome Team can get you going, but as hub coordinator, I have a great birds eye of view of everything going on. Or schedule your Welcome Call with me if you are especially interested in helping with Comms or Social Media!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Feel free to always schedule a call if you want to connect in any other way! I have a crazy work schedule (I&#39;m a flight attendant) and this is the best way to get me on the phone lol&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;More about me: If I&#39;m not flying to somewhere warmer, or working on Sunrise, you&#39;ll find me dancing or playing pool.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/details&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/article&gt;&#xA;    &lt;article class=&#34;welcome-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h2&gt;Jiyoo&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3&gt;Infra Lead&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://cal.com/jiyoo?members=1&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Chat with Jiyoo&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;details&gt;&#xA;        &lt;summary&gt;More about Jiyoo&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;🌟✧｡٩(ˊᗜˋ )و✧*｡! 🌟 &lt;strong&gt;Hello all big-picture strategists &amp;amp; nitty-gritty builders!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our hub&#39;s infrastructure lead, I help build up our physical and digital spaces 🛠&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;//// website, systems, logistics, &amp;amp; data 🧑‍💻💭&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;I like to stay active with dance/gym/run (&#39;ω&#39; ⊃ )⊃三二一 and creating art ✎ᝰ.ᐟ⋆⑅˚₊. Adventurous in both food tastes &amp;amp; travels; come talk to me about anything Sunrise ☀️ or life!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;I work full-time, so my typical hours are before or after work M-F. If you want to chat outside of those times, feel free to reach out separately over DMs!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Best way to reach me: Send me a funny picture on Signal: &lt;strong&gt;@goose.495&lt;/strong&gt; or IG: &lt;strong&gt;@goose_jiyoo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/details&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/article&gt;&#xA;    &lt;article class=&#34;welcome-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h2&gt;Luc&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h3&gt;Flock Campaign Lead&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://cal.com/lbouchard/30min?members=1&amp;amp;user=lbouchard&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Chat with Luc&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;details&gt;&#xA;        &lt;summary&gt;More about Luc&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Whether you&#39;re brand new to Sunrise or a seasoned organizer, I&#39;d love to chat!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/details&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/article&gt;&#xA;    &lt;article class=&#34;welcome-card&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;h2&gt;Brooke&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;      &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://cal.com/brooke-bachman-cuf5fu/30min&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Chat with Brooke&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/article&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/section&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Get the Flock Out</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/get-the-flock-out/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/get-the-flock-out/</guid>
				<description>&lt;style&gt; &#xA;  strong { font-weight: bold; } &#xA;  li { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; } &#xA;  ul { margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px; } &#xA;  p { margin: 20px; } &#xA;  h2 {margin: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 50px; }&#xA;  h1 {margin: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 10px; color: black; }&#xA;&lt;/style&gt; &#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto;&#34;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Help Us Fight Flock&lt;/h1&gt; &#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;&#34;&gt; &#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/flock-landing-2-.png&#34; alt=&#34;Flock Camera Surveillance&#34; style=&#34;max-width: 500px; width: 100%; height: auto;&#34;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;/div&gt; &#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Flock Cameras are Putting Us All at Risk&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&#34;font-size:20px; text-align: center;&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Bay Area is home to &lt;a href=&#34;https://deflock.org/&#34;&gt;thousands&lt;/a&gt; of Flock cameras, and our local billionaires &lt;a href=&#34;https://missionlocal.org/2026/07/san-francisco-police-surveillance-center-drones-salesforce/&#34;&gt;spent millions&lt;/a&gt; to put them there.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Here&#39;s what&#39;s at stake:&lt;/p&gt; &#xA;  &lt;ul&gt; &#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;: Flock cameras read your license plate to track your movements and store the data for long periods of time, creating a detailed record of your location history.&lt;/li&gt; &#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ICE Access&lt;/strong&gt;: SFPD claims federal agencies like ICE don&#39;t have access to Flock data, but they&#39;ve been &lt;a href=&#34;https://missionlocal.org/2026/06/federal-agencies-sf-surveillance-flock-data-audit/&#34;&gt;repeatedly caught&lt;/a&gt; not upholding this promise.&lt;/li&gt; &#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Officer Abuse&lt;/strong&gt;: Data from Flock cameras has led to &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.newsobserver.com/news/state/north-carolina/article287381160.html&#34;&gt;wrongful arrests&lt;/a&gt;, profiling, and &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.kwch.com/2022/10/31/kechi-police-lieutenant-arrested-using-police-technology-stalk-wife/&#34;&gt;stalking ex-partners&lt;/a&gt; by police officers.&lt;/li&gt; &#xA;    &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limited Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: There&#39;s no substantial evidence that ALPRs effectively prevent crime, despite &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.404media.co/researcher-who-oversaw-flock-surveillance-study-now-has-concerns-about-it/&#34;&gt;Flock&#39;s unethical attempts&lt;/a&gt; to prove otherwise.&lt;/li&gt; &#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt; &#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;What Can You Do?&lt;/h2&gt; &#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;&#34;&gt; &#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://partiful.com/e/sqiZe0yFbPmLV9WJasRm&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener noreferrer&#34; style=&#34;display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 500px; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/img/movie-premiere-8-x-8-in-.png&#34; alt=&#34;Flock Camera Surveillance&#34; style=&#34;width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p style=&#34;font-size:20px; text-align: center;&#34;&gt;So the billionaires feel entitled to surveil us? Well, we&#39;re flipping the script.&lt;strong&gt; We&#39;re going to watch them.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;&#34;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://partiful.com/e/sqiZe0yFbPmLV9WJasRm&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; style=&#34;width: 500px;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Come to our Billionaire Watch Party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;&#34;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://smvmt.us/flightschool&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; style=&#34;width: 500px;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Get Trained on our Flock Campaign.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;&#34;&gt; &#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;https://noalprs.com/&#34; class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; style=&#34;width: 500px;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Join the National Week of Action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Wildfire/Heatwave Mutual Aid</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/wildfire/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/wildfire/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;col col-12&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1 style=&#34;color: #33342e&#34; &gt;Wildfire/Heatwave Mutual Aid&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt; &#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col col-12 col-lg-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Overview&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;The goal of this campaign is to organize mutual aid and other forms of lasting support for communities most impacted by the fires, smoke, and extreme heat. We can support each other through the fire/heat season and reduce the harmful health impacts with effective mutual aid.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;btn-group-vertical&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://forms.gle/5JvZCjTE5MA6JYZg6&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&#xA;      Fill out our interest form&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col col-12 col-lg-6&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#39;http://localhost:1313/img/orangesky.jpg&#39; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt; &#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;col col-12 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;What we do&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;We are providing support and resources to organizations already mobilizing mutual aid in response to fires (e.g. providing masks, air filters, water, etc) and working to identify/fill gaps that these other organizations aren’t already covering.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
	</channel>
</rss>
